### 1. Admin creates a teacher (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"t1","password":"pass123","fullName":"Dr. Ada","email":"ada@uni.edu","department":"CS"}

### 2. Admin creates a student (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"s1","password":"pass123","fullName":"Sam","email":"sam@uni.edu","program":"Software Eng"}

### 3. List teachers (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 4. Teacher edits own record (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/teachers/1
Authorization: Basic t1 pass123
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Dr. Ada L.","email":"ada@uni.edu","department":"CS"}

### 5. Teacher edits a student (expect 403)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/students/1
Authorization: Basic t1 pass123
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Hacked","email":"x@uni.edu","program":"X"}

### 6. Student deletes a teacher (expect 403)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/teachers/1
Authorization: Basic s1 pass123

### 7. No login (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers